<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#menstrual_cycle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The biological process in human females involving the shedding of the uterine lining, typically occurring monthly. In the meme, it is referenced as a reason for the protagonist's inability to pursue romantic or sexual activity with his partner, implying a temporary biological restriction. This is a real-world physiological phenomenon that is culturally and socially coded, often stigmatized or trivialized in crude humor."@en .
