<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#man> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A man with a dark beard and mustache, wearing a white head covering (possibly a keffiyeh or ghutra) and a dark blue traditional garment (possibly a kandura or dishdasha). He is smiling broadly and gesturing with both hands open, palms facing forward. His facial features include a prominent nose and full lips. The man appears to be of Middle Eastern or South Asian descent, based on his physical appearance and attire. His expression and gesture suggest enthusiasm or excitement."@en .
