<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#assertion_about_01235> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme trivializes menstruation and suggests an absurd, crude solution involving a goat, which can be seen as demeaning to women and reinforcing negative stereotypes about menstruation."@en .
