<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'when you're feeling horny asf but your habibi is on periods let's try a goat' describes a first-person scenario. The visual material shows a man with a broad smile and open-handed gesture, which is mapped onto the textual protagonist as the person experiencing the described situation. The man's enthusiastic expression and gesture serve as a visual representation of the protagonist's emotional state and decision-making process in the text."@en .
