<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#stereotype_muslims_sex_with_animals> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A harmful and false stereotype that has been used in various forms of media and internet content to demean or caricature Muslims. The meme's suggestion to 'try a goat' when one's partner is menstruating can be interpreted as invoking this stereotype, even if not explicitly stated. This stereotype is offensive and perpetuates Islamophobia."@en .
