<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The visual representation of the protagonist in the meme, depicted as a man wearing a white head covering (keffiyeh or ghutra) and a dark blue traditional garment (kandura or dishdasha), smiling and gesturing enthusiastically. This attire and appearance are used to stereotype or associate him with a specific cultural or religious group, primarily Muslims, which is a key component of the meme's target community and its toxic implications."@en .
